  "description": "\"Now, choose. Do you want to run away forever? Or do you want to hide forever?\"\n\nOne day, a portal to another dimension called the 'Channel' opened up all over the world. As soon as the Channel opened, alien races from other dimensions began to appear on Earth, and humanity began to awaken their magical talents.\n\nHowever, Yoon Min-jun was able to use magic long before the Channel opened. This is the story of a reclusive loner who was once the only magician on Earth and was forced to leave his NEET lifestyle. \n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10587446)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/171857)",
